      "text": "Dr. Sunita Iyer has an opening on Mon 12 Oct at 10:00 am. \n\nJust to confirm, I will book a first consultation for Ishaan Reddy with Dr. Sunita Iyer on Mon 12 Oct at 10:00 am. Is that correct?"
